          "text": "Today is my 4 Year Top Surgery Anniversary🥂\n\nI wanted to say: If you are not trans, don’t fully understand it, or can’t even begin to grasp the concept, please know this;   \n\nTransitioning saves lives.   \n\nI remember 4+ years ago sitting down with my Mom and having to tell her that if I wasn’t able to transition, I couldn’t see myself living past 18.  \n\nI am now 23, working my dream job, living with the love of my life, able to shower comfortably, hug my loved ones and wear clothes I love without feeling awful.  \n\nYou may not understand it, and you do not need to! But just from human to fellow human, this?   \n\nIt saves lives🏳️‍⚧️🤍"
        },
